{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790782260, "covers_from": "2026-09-30T15:31:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-30T15:32:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790782320, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-30T15:31:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 54345, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "其他", "content": "我住敬業三路近萬豪酒店以前附近還有大賣場「家樂福」家庭主婦買菜方便但是關了之後要走到北安路才有市場！", "display_name": "中山代表 黃千代", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T15:31:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "queue_number": 54346, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "體育", "content": "台北田徑場一直有辦田徑比賽\n也有國際賽事（國邀）\n29年也會舉辦亞錦賽\n但很少人進場看比賽", "display_name": "松山代表 No.54,346", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T15:31:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 54216, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北的腳踏車越來越普及，是件好事。但是請市長訂定行車指引。我不想一直跟路上公車、汽車、機車爭道、爭快", "display_name": "松山代表 No.54,216", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T15:31:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 32896, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "不喜歡每次去台北市路很難開，對開車騎車的人很不友善，在台北我不開導航我根本不敢開太多單行道跟不能轉彎", "display_name": "大安代表 蘇聖閔", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 54346, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.54,346", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 54216, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.54,216", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 32896, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 蘇聖閔", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 54347, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 🎬EDDIE⚔️TSAI🎬